格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DSH WebUI 深链插件：?session=/?workspace= 直接打开指定项目对话","id":"gh:1333119284","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-deeplink","slug":"qyw233/dsh-deeplink","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DSH WebUI 深链插件：?session=/?workspace= 直接打开指定项目对话"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-deeplink — WebUI deep-link plugin"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A DeepSeek Harness Web UI plugin that opens a **specific project conversation** directly from a URL "},{"id":"p3s2","text":"query parameter, instead of always returning to the last session."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"- `?session=<session-id>` → open that conversation\n- `?workspace=<workspace-id>` → open that project"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"'s latest/blank conversation\n- Persistent links: the address bar follows the current conversation, s"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"o you can copy/bookmark/share the link at any time\n- Settings toggles to enable/disable jumping and "},{"id":"p4s4","text":"address-bar following independently\n- Ships a model prompt section so the model surfaces clickable d"},{"id":"p4s5","text":"eep links when a reply refers to another conversation or project"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"License: MIT"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- Reads `?session=` / `?workspace=` from the page URL and switches once the session/workspace list b"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"aseline is ready\n- `session` wins when both parameters are present\n- When the target session/workspa"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"ce does not exist (or is archived/hidden), it silently falls back to the default behavior (restore t"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"he last session) — no errors, no impact on the page\n- Persistent links: whenever the current session"},{"id":"p7s5","text":" changes (deep-link switch or a manual switch in the UI), the address bar is rewritten to `?session="},{"id":"p7s6","text":"<current-session-id>` via `history.replaceState`; when no session is current, the parameters are cle"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"ared. No history pollution, no reload\n- Settings toggles: two independent switches (设置 → 插件 → 插件配置, "},{"id":"p7s8","text":"shown as a card via the official `settings.plugin.item` slot, keyed by the `dsh-deeplink` settings n"},{"id":"p7s9","text":"amespace) — `jump` (process `?session=`/`?workspace=` on load, default on) and `follow` (address-bar"},{"id":"p7s10","text":" following, default on), both persisted in `localStorage`\n- The node half registers a global prompt "},{"id":"p7s11","text":"section so the model knows deep links exist and can attach links when a reply refers to other conver"},{"id":"p7s12","text":"sations/projects\n- Pure browser half + a lightweight node half; no cordis import, no peerDependencie"},{"id":"p7s13","text":"ations/projects\n- Pure browser half + a lightweight node half; no cordis import, no peerDependencies"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"The plugin is installed into a profile via the standard `dsh plugin` mechanism — **no DSH source cha"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"stalled into a profile via the standard `dsh plugin` mechanism — **no DSH source changes required**."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"The repository ships its build output (`lib/` is committed), so no additional build step is required"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"ships its build output (`lib/` is committed), so no additional build step is required after install."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"After installing, restart the Web UI and refresh the browser page. The plugin appears in the browser"},{"id":"p12s2","text":" boot graph (`__DSH_BOOT__`)."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Usage"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Append query parameters to the WebUI URL:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| Parameter | Meaning | Example |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| `?session=<session-id>` | Open that conversation | `http://127.0.0.1:3080/?session=session-304ae36"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"e-1e66-453a-a946-2b0a9a2b173d` |\n| `?workspace=<workspace-id>` | Open that project's latest/blank co"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"nversation | `http://127.0.0.1:3080/?workspace=fc8b75ae-107c-4b6c-978c-276270b03b8b` |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"New window/tab behavior:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"- Clicking a deep link inside a conversation: the GUI's markdown renderer adds `target=\"_blank\"` to "},{"id":"p18s2","text":"all http(s) links, so a new tab opens and the plugin switches THAT tab to the target conversation.\n-"},{"id":"p18s3","text":" Pasting `?session=...` into the current tab's address bar and pressing Enter: the current page swit"},{"id":"p18s4","text":"ing `?session=...` into the current tab's address bar and pressing Enter: the current page switches."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Persistent links:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"- After a deep link opens, the address bar updates to `?session=<actual-session-id>` (the `workspace"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"` parameter is consumed and removed).\n- Manually switching conversations in the UI updates the addre"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"ss bar the same way.\n- Switching to the \"no session / new\" state clears the parameters and returns t"},{"id":"p20s4","text":"he address bar to `/`.\n- Updates use `history.replaceState`, so each conversation is not left in the"},{"id":"p20s5","text":" browser back/forward history."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Settings"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"The plugin registers a **深链** card in the 插件配置 tab (设置 → 插件 → 插件配置, via the official `settings.plugi"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"n.item` slot, keyed by the `dsh-deeplink` settings namespace registered on the host) with two indepe"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"ndent toggles (both default on, persisted in `localStorage`):"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| Toggle | Key | Effect |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| 跳转到指定对话 | `dsh-deeplink.jump` | Process `?session=` / `?workspace=` deep links on page load. Read "},{"id":"p24s2","text":"once per load — toggle it before opening a deep link. |\n| 地址栏跟随 | `dsh-deeplink.follow` | Keep the a"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"ddress bar following the current session. Read on every sync, so toggling takes effect immediately. "},{"id":"p24s4","text":"dress bar following the current session. Read on every sync, so toggling takes effect immediately. |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Model prompt"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"The node half registers a global prompt section (`plugin:dsh-deeplink`, order −97, after web-surface"},{"id":"p26s2","text":" and before persona) that tells the model:"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"- This GUI supports `?session=` / `?workspace=` deep links (a click opens them in a new tab);\n[该节后续省"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"This GUI supports `?session=` / `?workspace=` deep links (a click opens them in a new tab);\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## Version compatibility"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"The browser half is pure client: no cordis import, no peerDependencies, and depends only on the runt"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"ime-provided `sessions` / `workspaces` services and their `list` snapshots. The node half depends on"},{"id":"p29s3","text":" the `systemPrompt` / `webServer` services (both provided by the dsh-base and web compositions), and"},{"id":"p29s4","text":" registers its optional settings namespace through the stable `ctx.settings.register()` API. It has "},{"id":"p29s5","text":"been adapted to the `httpServer` → `webServer` service rename and ships a `dsh.bundle` declaration ("},{"id":"p29s6","text":"`cordis.patch.yml`) for the newer `dsh plugin` bundle mechanism."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"### 2026-09-13 · v0.6.1 — Current DSH settings compatibility"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"- Replaced the removed `settingsNamespace` / `installSettingsSection` named imports with direct opti"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"onal-service registration through `ctx.settings.register()`.\n- Restored startup compatibility with c"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"urrent DSH releases while preserving the configurable-plugin card and browser-local toggle behavior."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"### 2026-08-13 · v0.4.0 — Persistent links + newer-version compatibility"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"- Address bar follows the current session: after a deep-link switch or a manual switch, the URL is r"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"ewritten to `?session=<current-session-id>` via `history.replaceState`; cleared when no session is c"},{"id":"p33s3","text":"urrent. No history pollution, no reload.\n- Adapted to the `httpServer` → `webServer` service rename."},{"id":"p33s4","text":"\n- Added the `dsh.bundle` declaration and `cordis.patch.yml` for the newer `dsh plugin` bundle mecha"},{"id":"p33s5","text":"ded the `dsh.bundle` declaration and `cordis.patch.yml` for the newer `dsh plugin` bundle mechanism."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
